After the two grace days have been used, any assignment submitted late will receive a 0. A grace day will be 
counted for any assignment submitted after 11:59p.m. on the due date. To state that another way, if an 
assignment is submitted after the due date, at 12:00a.m. (midnight) or later, grace days will be used. The 
grace days do not need to be approved by the professor, but any exceptions other than grace days will need 
